      "message": "[error] Line 1512: 🔴 `\"initial\"` commit decoding checks `conversation.mode.blockingFirst() \u003d\u003d Feed`, which misses feeds while the conversation is still `Syncing` or `Request` (where identity now lives in `effectiveMode`/request metadata). In those states, the code falls through to `INVALID`, so the `FEED_CREATED` event can be dropped and the feed won’t get its intended creation event/timestamp ordering. Use `conversation.effectiveMode` (or decode from the commit `mode` field) for this branch so feed initial commits are consistently emitted.",
